  "verified": [
    "Actual DCN1 C plane/CNVC RGB10, no OPP eight-bit truncation, physical 5:4 TMDS clock and original PHY PLL DTO programming.",
    "Source/sink/current receiver/exact timing/budget admission precedes allocation and MMIO; CTA VIC survives DTD deduplication.",
    "Actual SDMA pixel copy from the separately encoded mode reference; RGB10/PQ rollback, HLG confirm, explicit SDR HDR metadata clear.",
    "Implicit CTA Limited mode maps an explicitly CPU-readable canonical SYSTEM/XR24 pattern, converts bounded rows once before private BO publication and retains leases through both frames.",
    "Limited initial black 16 and white 235; explicit encoded requests do not receive double quantization.",
    "Common ICC/VCGT COLOR_V1 CPU path produces matching output quantization and unchanged canonical SDR capture; explicit Full on Limited must pass receiver admission.",
    "Independent per-output source color capabilities and known/fixed refresh state without unimplemented VRR/LFC flags.",
    "Existing R4GFX color/ICC/YUV and native AMD/NVIDIA facade tests; existing Desktop render tests; final SMP4 actual loaded shared color/UI/service integration."
  ],
